{"server":"cn","storyId":"act40side_level_act40side_st01","groupId":"act40side","stageId":"act40side_st01","title":"陈皮菊花茶","storyCode":"OR-ST-1","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act40side/level_act40side_st01.txt","sourceHash":"5847cd0158daf9f97d1904ed0be785b0df7ca6e51982844899a9f75ac166e418","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"四十年前，真龙去世的消息使得整个炎国上下震动。在晚春的雨夜，匆匆离开百灶城的，有一位皇子，还有一位携家带口的书生。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor"},{"type":"narration","text":"先生是说，大炎历史上当真有这么一位奇人？\n是......\n收录书卷，整理文字，推广教育......为何她为天下苍生做了这么多事，却没有人记得她，甚至没有人知道她的名字？\n先生，这是什么字？我似乎从来没有见过？\n并非无人记得“她”，只是她的一字真名，没有被史书记录在册。\n这样岂不可惜？明明她的笔写下了炎国悠久的历史，写遍了炎国万里的山河，可史书中没有一页留下了她的名字......\n您说......如果我把这些史书尽数补全，能从中还原出她的模样吗？\n四十年前"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=2>1062年4月21日    谷雨</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吆喝的伙计","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"客人，客人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吆喝的伙计","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这么大的雨，进来喝壶热茶，避避雨再走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的男性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不必了。这场雨眼看着一时半刻也停不下来，还是快些赶路吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吆喝的伙计","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，有人盼着这场雨停下，可还有人盼着它多下一阵哩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吆喝的伙计","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"卖伞的商贩笑开花，就是愁死了赶路人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的男性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阁下说的话倒是有趣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吆喝的伙计","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"客人还是歇歇脚吧。有人托我嘱咐您，前路坑洼不好走，怕您踏错沾湿了鞋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的男性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吆喝的伙计","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"客人，这边请吧，要见您的那位已经在里面等着了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g13_yanlivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"尚书大人......好久不见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，现在应该称......太傅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"玉门一别，的确很久不见了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以为这次回京述职，应该要先见司岁台和兵部才对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我才赶在那之前来见你一面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......陛下驾崩了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何时......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"半月前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想......如果陛下是寿终正寝，太傅也不会专程来见我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"坐在阴影中的人伸出手，他的掌心，正躺着一枚黑色云子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"六十年前，他逃离了那座古寺，将自己化作一百八十一颗黑子，分散各地，至今下落不明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而就在半月前，司岁台在京城发现了这一枚黑子的踪迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他做了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尚不知晓......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唯一可以确定的是，他绝无可能进入禁城......应是有人主动见了他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个人的身份，不方便去查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他想做的事，按理不该牵扯到旁人才是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天我本不该见你。可当初那个罪人引起动乱时，毕竟是你亲手将他制服的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......宗师，对此事你知道什么吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......并无所知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那次事故之后，我也没有再见过他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我相信宗师。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"需要我做些什么吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要停留，即刻返回玉门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乌萨斯动荡不断，玉门守将新旧交替，这个时间，切不可再使人心动荡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"司岁台与兵部，我自会处理。你不在局中，我才能以重任相托。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"棋局之事，我会让司岁台暗中继续查下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特殊时期，宗师不便再露面——你可以当今日没有见过我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真龙他究竟是......炎武殿下还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个时候，他应该——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"炎武......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陛下去世的那天晚上，是炎武去见了他。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g5_dragonpalace"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1239_1","isRemote":false,"text":"启禀殿下，那叛臣一族二十八人皆已收监。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1239_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可核对名录时发现，其家中本应有一个尚不满月的婴儿——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1239_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是禁军今天在太师府中搜查时，将整个宅子翻了个底朝天，也没有找到那婴儿的下落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帷幕后的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......一个还在襁褓里的孩子，总不会是自己逃走的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帷幕后的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"还是有人惦记着她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1239_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殿下不必烦扰，禁军会找到她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帷幕后的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1239_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天早些时候，刑部尚书求见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1239_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一系列的案子，到底该怎么审怎么办，他想征求殿下的意见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帷幕后的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......依炎律审。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1239_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会转告他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帷幕后的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的那位兄长，现在到何处了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1239_1","isRemote":false,"text":"据守军报告，半个时辰前刚出京城。有部分禁军，追随他叛逃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1239_1","isRemote":false,"text":"守城士兵未得军令，不敢阻拦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帷幕后的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是啊......我的确没有下过要将他留在百灶的命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帷幕后的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是他不愿意留下，弃了所有人而去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帷幕后的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"跟着他走的禁军......有多少人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1239_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十八人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帷幕后的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我这位兄长，就算犯下了这样的滔天罪行，还是可以让太师替他赴死，还是可以让这十八死士愿意追随他而去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帷幕后的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这满朝文武，还有多少人的心在他那里？有多少人，还在盼望他回来坐这个位置？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1239_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可如今，是殿下在这个位置。让炎国万世昌宁的责任，也在殿下身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1239_1","isRemote":false,"text":"炎国上下，任谁都可以心思徘徊，犹疑不定......唯独殿下您不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帷幕后的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帷幕后的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我有许久没有走出这座宫殿了......太尉，告诉我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帷幕后的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"百灶的这场春雨，停了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1239_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要殿下想，这场雨就可以停下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1239_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......若殿下改了主意，还来得及将他们留下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帷幕后的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帷幕后的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......乏了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"侍从","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"御膳司备了些八宝攒汤和水笋丝，殿下可要用点？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帷幕后的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"起菜吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1239_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wilderness_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"乖......乖......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不哭不哭，我们回家去......就快要到家了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仓皇的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再快些......劳驾，麻烦您再快些......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车夫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这么大的雨，路都看不清，不能再快啦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仓皇的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"离下一个驿站还有多远？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车夫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎么也得三十里地吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车夫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这位兄弟，您是有多要紧的事......拖家带口的，怎么就偏挑这么个晚上赶路啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仓皇的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仓皇的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......请快些吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车夫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊......！啊！什么东西——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车夫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"见鬼了！这荒郊野外的，怎么还有活人啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仓皇的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"男人四下张望，绵延不绝的雨幕遮住了视线，夜色茫茫，什么都看不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仓皇的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不可以再乘车了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仓皇的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"劳驾，这些钱都留给您。请把车驶到前面的驿站去，要是有人问起的话，千万不要说今晚拉过带着孩子的客人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仓皇的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在下拜谢先生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车夫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是......这，唉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车夫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这么大的雨，您要上哪去啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仓皇的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从小路走......穿过北边的林子——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仓皇的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"孩子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"孩子不见了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仓皇的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g11_yanroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是......那个孩子。"},{"type":"narration","text":"襁褓中的婴儿睡得香甜，脸蛋上沾染了泥污与血污也浑然不觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"满手血污的人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您交代我办的事，我都已经办成了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"满手血污的人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他们的手段，我都清楚，也知道该怎么应付。大人不必担忧，我绝不会让半点血沾在您的身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生大义......老朽无以为报。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"满手血污的人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不......您不该谢我，我不是为您才做这件事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"满手血污的人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那位大人曾有大恩于我。我做的这件事，却不能为她洗净冤屈，甚至连为她报仇都谈不上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"满手血污的人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我没有亲人，不用操心身后事。想拜托大人的，也就只有这一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"满手血污的人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大人......请您收养这个孩子吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"满手血污的人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您不必告诉她什么，只要让她平安长大，安稳地活过这一辈子就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你知道，她留在这，就多一分风险，多一分将这桩旧案重新翻出来的可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"满手血污的人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可这难道不是您盼望的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"满手血污的人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"时势使然，现在我们注定无可奈何。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"满手血污的人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是总有一天，不管三十年也好，四十年也好......只要有朝一日，真相能大白于天下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"满手血污的人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这些血......就不算白流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我答应你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
